    user_response: "**\"Build the Streamlit interface for IGCSE High 5 based on my System Instructions.1. Create the three nested dropdown menus exactly as specified.\n2. Initialize the connection to the Gemini API (using 1.5-flash for speed).\n3. Write the function to send the user\342\200\231s selections to the model.\n4. Display the results in three clear Markdown containers: The Question, The 1\342\200\2235 Mark Scheme, and The Sentence Starters.\n5. Make sure the code for Dropdown 2 updates dynamically based on Dropdown 1. For example, if you pick \"Paper 2: Human,\" it should only show HU6 through HU10.  \n\nI am attaching examples for a knowledge bank"
