  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Bento Grid\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Bento Grid\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-[#f8fafc] text-slate-900 flex flex-col overflow-hidden font-sans\\\">\\n  <!-- Top Navigation -->\\n  <nav class=\\\"h-16 bg-white border-b border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-between px-8 shrink-0\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"text-white font-bold text-lg\\\">5</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <h1 class=\\\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-800\\\">IGCSE <span class=\\\"text-indigo-600\\\">High 5</span></h1>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 bg-green-50 text-green-700 rounded-full border border-green-100\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 bg-green-500 rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\\\">Gemini 1.5 Flash Connected</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-slate-200 border border-slate-300\\\"></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </nav>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"flex flex-1 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n    <!-- Sidebar Controls -->\\n    <aside class=\\\"w-80 bg-white border-r border-slate-200 p-6 flex flex-col gap-6 shrink-0\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <label class=\\\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\\\">Dropdown 1: Select Component</label>\\n        <select class=\\\"w-full p-2.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 outline-none\\\">\\n          <option>Paper 2: Human Geography</option>\\n          <option>Paper 1: Physical Geography</option>\\n          <option>Paper 4: Alternative to Coursework</option>\\n        </select>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div>\\n        <label class=\\\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\\\">Dropdown 2: Unit Selection</label>\\n        <select class=\\\"w-full p-2.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 outline-none\\\">\\n          <option>HU7: Development</option>\\n          <option>HU6: Population & Migration</option>\\n          <option>HU8: Food Production</option>\\n          <option>HU9: Industry</option>\\n          <option>HU10: Tourism</option>\\n        </select>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div>\\n        <label class=\\\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\\\">Dropdown 3: Question Format</label>\\n        <select class=\\\"w-full p-2.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 outline-none\\\">\\n          <option>7-Mark Case Study</option>\\n          <option>4-Mark Data Interpretation</option>\\n          <option>5-Mark Explain Question</option>\\n        </select>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <button class=\\\"w-full mt-4 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-colors\\\">\\n        <span>Generate Materials</span>\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z\\\" /></svg>\\n      </button>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"mt-auto p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-dashed border-slate-300\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed uppercase font-semibold\\\">\\n          System: Using Knowledge Bank [IGCSE_GEO_V2]\\n          <br>Temp: 0.7 | Top-P: 0.95\\n        </p>\\n      </div>\\n    </aside>\\n\\n    <!-- Main Content (Bento Grid) -->\\n    <main class=\\\"flex-1 p-8 grid grid-cols-12 grid-rows-12 gap-6\\\">\\n      \\n      <!-- The Question -->\\n      <section class=\\\"col-span-12 row-span-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-6 overflow-hidden flex flex-col\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-2 h-6 bg-indigo-500 rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n          <h2 class=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest\\\">The Question</h2>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"prose prose-slate max-w-none\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-xl font-medium leading-relaxed text-slate-800\\\">\\n            For a named country you have studied, explain why the government is working to increase the country\342\200\231s level of development. [7]\\n          </p>\\n          <div class=\\\"mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 text-xs font-bold rounded border border-amber-100\\\">\\n            CASE STUDY REQUIRED\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <!-- The 1-5 Mark Scheme -->\\n      <section class=\\\"col-span-6 row-span-8 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-6 overflow-hidden flex flex-col\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-2 h-6 bg-rose-500 rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n          <h2 class=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest\\\">1\342\200\2235 Mark Scheme</h2>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4 overflow-y-auto pr-2\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-rose-400\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"block text-xs font-bold text-rose-600\\\">Level 1 (1\342\200\2233 Marks)</span>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-sm text-slate-600\\\">Statements include some limited explanatory points. Lists simple reasons like \'jobs\' or \'money\' without elaboration.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-amber-400\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"block text-xs font-bold text-amber-600\\\">Level 2 (4\342\200\2236 Marks)</span>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-sm text-slate-600\\\">Uses development indicators (GNI per capita, HDI). Explains the link between industrialization and improved infrastructure.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"p-3 bg-indigo-50 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-indigo-400\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"block text-xs font-bold text-indigo-600\\\">Level 3 (7 Marks)</span>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-sm text-slate-600\\\">Detailed explanation for a named country (e.g., Vietnam). Specific data used to show government policy impact.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <!-- The Sentence Starters -->\\n      <section class=\\\"col-span-6 row-span-8 bg-[#1e293b] rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 shadow-xl p-6 overflow-hidden flex flex-col\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-2 h-6 bg-cyan-400 rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n          <h2 class=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Sentence Starters</h2>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-3\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"p-4 bg-slate-800/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 font-mono text-sm text-cyan-50 flex gap-3\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-slate-500\\\">01</span>\\n            <p>\\\"A key reason why the government of [Country] is prioritizing...\\\"</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"p-4 bg-slate-800/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 font-mono text-sm text-cyan-50 flex gap-3\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-slate-500\\\">02</span>\\n            <p>\\\"Furthermore, improving the HDI is vital because it leads to...\\\"</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"p-4 bg-slate-800/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 font-mono text-sm text-cyan-50 flex gap-3\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-slate-500\\\">03</span>\\n            <p>\\\"This shift from primary to secondary industry results in...\\\"</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"p-4 bg-slate-800/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 font-mono text-sm text-cyan-50 flex gap-3\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-slate-500\\\">04</span>\\n            <p>\\\"As a consequence, the multiplier effect creates...\\\"</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n    </main>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Bento Grid\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Bento Grid\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-[#f8fafc] text-slate-900 flex flex-col overflow-hidden font-sans\\\">\\n  <!-- Top Navigation -->\\n  <nav class=\\\"h-16 bg-white border-b border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-between px-8 shrink-0\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"text-white font-bold text-lg\\\">5</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <h1 class=\\\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-800\\\">IGCSE <span class=\\\"text-indigo-600\\\">High 5</span></h1>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 bg-green-50 text-green-700 rounded-full border border-green-100\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 bg-green-500 rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\\\">Gemini 1.5 Flash Connected</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-slate-200 border border-slate-300\\\"></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </nav>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"flex flex-1 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n    <!-- Sidebar Controls -->\\n    <aside class=\\\"w-80 bg-white border-r border-slate-200 p-6 flex flex-col gap-6 shrink-0\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <label class=\\\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\\\">Dropdown 1: Select Component</label>\\n        <select class=\\\"w-full p-2.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 outline-none\\\">\\n          <option>Paper 2: Human Geography</option>\\n          <option>Paper 1: Physical Geography</option>\\n          <option>Paper 4: Alternative to Coursework</option>\\n        </select>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div>\\n        <label class=\\\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\\\">Dropdown 2: Unit Selection</label>\\n        <select class=\\\"w-full p-2.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 outline-none\\\">\\n          <option>HU7: Development</option>\\n          <option>HU6: Population & Migration</option>\\n          <option>HU8: Food Production</option>\\n          <option>HU9: Industry</option>\\n          <option>HU10: Tourism</option>\\n        </select>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div>\\n        <label class=\\\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\\\">Dropdown 3: Question Format</label>\\n        <select class=\\\"w-full p-2.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 outline-none\\\">\\n          <option>7-Mark Case Study</option>\\n          <option>4-Mark Data Interpretation</option>\\n          <option>5-Mark Explain Question</option>\\n        </select>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <button class=\\\"w-full mt-4 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-colors\\\">\\n        <span>Generate Materials</span>\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z\\\" /></svg>\\n      </button>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"mt-auto p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-dashed border-slate-300\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed uppercase font-semibold\\\">\\n          System: Using Knowledge Bank [IGCSE_GEO_V2]\\n          <br>Temp: 0.7 | Top-P: 0.95\\n        </p>\\n      </div>\\n    </aside>\\n\\n    <!-- Main Content (Bento Grid) -->\\n    <main class=\\\"flex-1 p-8 grid grid-cols-12 grid-rows-12 gap-6\\\">\\n      \\n      <!-- The Question -->\\n      <section class=\\\"col-span-12 row-span-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-6 overflow-hidden flex flex-col\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-2 h-6 bg-indigo-500 rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n          <h2 class=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest\\\">The Question</h2>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"prose prose-slate max-w-none\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-xl font-medium leading-relaxed text-slate-800\\\">\\n            For a named country you have studied, explain why the government is working to increase the country\342\200\231s level of development. [7]\\n          </p>\\n          <div class=\\\"mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 text-xs font-bold rounded border border-amber-100\\\">\\n            CASE STUDY REQUIRED\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <!-- The 1-5 Mark Scheme -->\\n      <section class=\\\"col-span-6 row-span-8 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-6 overflow-hidden flex flex-col\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-2 h-6 bg-rose-500 rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n          <h2 class=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest\\\">1\342\200\2235 Mark Scheme</h2>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4 overflow-y-auto pr-2\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-rose-400\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"block text-xs font-bold text-rose-600\\\">Level 1 (1\342\200\2233 Marks)</span>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-sm text-slate-600\\\">Statements include some limited explanatory points. Lists simple reasons like \'jobs\' or \'money\' without elaboration.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-amber-400\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"block text-xs font-bold text-amber-600\\\">Level 2 (4\342\200\2236 Marks)</span>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-sm text-slate-600\\\">Uses development indicators (GNI per capita, HDI). Explains the link between industrialization and improved infrastructure.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"p-3 bg-indigo-50 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-indigo-400\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"block text-xs font-bold text-indigo-600\\\">Level 3 (7 Marks)</span>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-sm text-slate-600\\\">Detailed explanation for a named country (e.g., Vietnam). Specific data used to show government policy impact.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <!-- The Sentence Starters -->\\n      <section class=\\\"col-span-6 row-span-8 bg-[#1e293b] rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 shadow-xl p-6 overflow-hidden flex flex-col\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-2 h-6 bg-cyan-400 rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n          <h2 class=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Sentence Starters</h2>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-3\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"p-4 bg-slate-800/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 font-mono text-sm text-cyan-50 flex gap-3\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-slate-500\\\">01</span>\\n            <p>\\\"A key reason why the government of [Country] is prioritizing...\\\"</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"p-4 bg-slate-800/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 font-mono text-sm text-cyan-50 flex gap-3\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-slate-500\\\">02</span>\\n            <p>\\\"Furthermore, improving the HDI is vital because it leads to...\\\"</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"p-4 bg-slate-800/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 font-mono text-sm text-cyan-50 flex gap-3\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-slate-500\\\">03</span>\\n            <p>\\\"This shift from primary to secondary industry results in...\\\"</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"p-4 bg-slate-800/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 font-mono text-sm text-cyan-50 flex gap-3\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-slate-500\\\">04</span>\\n            <p>\\\"As a consequence, the multiplier effect creates...\\\"</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n    </main>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    }
  }
}
